sequenceDiagram
    participant Pipeline as Data Science Pipeline<br/>(KFP)
    participant ai4rag as ai4rag Library
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    participant MaaS as MaaS Endpoint<br/>(vLLM / OpenAI-compatible)<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    participant VectorDB as Vector Store<br/>(Milvus/PGVector/Chroma)

    Note over Pipeline,VectorDB: Phase 1: Document Ingestion

    Pipeline->>ai4rag: Execute RAG optimization task
    ai4rag->>S3: GET documents<br/>Auth: AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID + AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
    S3-->>ai4rag: Raw documents
    ai4rag->>ai4rag: Text extraction (Docling)<br/>Chunk documents (configurable strategy)

    Note over Pipeline,VectorDB: Phase 2: Embedding & Indexing

    ai4rag->>MaaS: POST /v1/embeddings<br/>Auth: API Key<br/>TLS (verify=False fallback)
    MaaS-->>ai4rag: Embedding vectors
    ai4rag->>VectorDB: Index vectors<br/>Milvus: gRPC/TLS (PEM cert)<br/>PGVector: PostgreSQL wire protocol<br/>Chroma: HTTP
    VectorDB-->>ai4rag: Index confirmation

    Note over Pipeline,VectorDB: Phase 3: RAG Query & Evaluation (per HPO iteration)

    loop GAM Hyperparameter Optimization
        ai4rag->>ai4rag: Select configuration<br/>(chunking, embedding model, LLM, retrieval params)

        ai4rag->>MaaS: POST /v1/embeddings<br/>Embed evaluation question
        MaaS-->>ai4rag: Query embedding

        ai4rag->>VectorDB: Similarity search<br/>Retrieve relevant chunks
        VectorDB-->>ai4rag: Retrieved context chunks

        ai4rag->>ai4rag: Build prompt with context

        ai4rag->>MaaS: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: API Key<br/>TLS (verify=False fallback)
        MaaS-->>ai4rag: LLM response (answer)

        ai4rag->>ai4rag: Evaluate answer<br/>(faithfulness, answer correctness,<br/>context correctness)

        ai4rag->>ai4rag: Update GAM model with scores
    end

    Note over Pipeline,VectorDB: Phase 4: Results

    ai4rag->>ai4rag: Rank RAG configurations by score
    ai4rag->>Pipeline: Report ranked patterns<br/>via KFP Event Handler
